      "rkaf:applicabilityCondition": "In determining whether an employee has been employed by the employer for at least 12 months where an employee has a break in service of more than seven years, and either the break was occasioned by fulfillment of a USERRA-covered service obligation or a written agreement concerning rehire exists."
    },
